            "review_title": "Review at Léon The Bar",
            "review_text": "Brianda M\n4 contributions\n0\nDon’t go they will scam you\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nDon’t go , they will scam you !!!\nI was there today and ordered 2 waters, a Caesar salad and a carbonara spaghetti. After more than an hour waiting (with the place empty) we decided to leave so we requested the bill. At first they refuse to gave us the bill for the waters, they talked to each other while we insisted , the situation was getting scarier as the time passed. Suddenly they came with a bill , VND 95.000 EACH WATER 🤯 (the market next door sells the water at VND 13.000, same brand) , we asked what happened , we’ve been travelling for weeks in Vietnam so we know the price is insane. They didn’t explain, se we decided to pay and leave. We spent a horrible moment. This was an abuse and I hope nobody has to experience that awful time again . So be aware of this place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 14, 2024",
