            "review_title": "Review at Léon The Bar",
            "review_text": "Roy David J\nBouvard, Australia342 contributions\n0\nGreat Quirky Bar\nApr 2023 • Couples\nSomething a little different but very pleasing.\n\nThis is a trendy cocktail bar with loads of character and charm. No neon lights, just subtle illumination with candles for added charm.\n\nThe drinks menu is extensive and the bar staff really know their cocktails. Some of the best margaritas we have found.\n\nGood service from cheerful efficient staff.\n\nA great find. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 23, 2023",
